WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.640
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Sarah. Welcome to Online A one, Book three.

2
00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:09.141
Hi! I'm Rithy. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.441 --> 00:00:16.703
Unit twenty-four: My Dream Holiday. In this unit, you will talk about plans for a dream holiday.

4
00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:18.706
Holiday.

5
00:00:19.406 --> 00:00:22.602
Holiday means a time when you don't go to school or work.

6
00:00:22.902 --> 00:00:24.866
We go on holiday in April.

7
00:00:25.566 --> 00:00:28.927
Your turn. Say: Holiday.

8
00:00:31.627 --> 00:00:32.663
Holiday.

9
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:34.372
Travel.

10
00:00:35.072 --> 00:00:37.792
Travel means to go from one place to another.

11
00:00:38.092 --> 00:00:40.080
I want to travel around the world.

12
00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:43.571
Your turn. Say: Travel.

13
00:00:46.271 --> 00:00:47.017
Travel.

14
00:00:48.017 --> 00:00:48.890
Plane.

15
00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:52.042
Plane means a machine with wings that flies.

16
00:00:52.342 --> 00:00:54.028
We will fly on a plane.

17
00:00:54.728 --> 00:00:57.590
Your turn. Say: Plane.

18
00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:01.093
Plane.

19
00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:03.061
Hotel.

20
00:01:03.761 --> 00:01:06.434
Hotel means a building where you pay to sleep.

21
00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:08.699
Our hotel is near the sea.

22
00:01:09.399 --> 00:01:12.562
Your turn. Say: Hotel.

23
00:01:15.262 --> 00:01:16.124
Hotel.

24
00:01:17.117 --> 00:01:17.932
Beach.

25
00:01:18.632 --> 00:01:21.050
Beach means the sand next to the sea.

26
00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:23.152
I will swim at the beach.

27
00:01:23.852 --> 00:01:26.446
Your turn. Say: Beach.

28
00:01:29.146 --> 00:01:29.926
Beach.

29
00:01:30.917 --> 00:01:31.871
Mountain.

30
00:01:32.571 --> 00:01:34.745
Mountain means a very high hill.

31
00:01:35.045 --> 00:01:36.638
I want to climb a mountain.

32
00:01:37.338 --> 00:01:40.153
Your turn. Say: Mountain.

33
00:01:42.853 --> 00:01:43.703
Mountain.

34
00:01:44.717 --> 00:01:45.590
Visit.

35
00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.824
Visit means to go to see a place or person.

36
00:01:49.124 --> 00:01:50.519
We will visit Kep.

37
00:01:51.219 --> 00:01:54.046
Your turn. Say: Visit.

38
00:01:56.746 --> 00:01:57.573
Visit.

39
00:01:58.583 --> 00:01:59.724
Suitcase.

40
00:02:00.424 --> 00:02:03.259
Suitcase means a bag for clothes when you travel.

41
00:02:03.559 --> 00:02:05.152
I will pack my suitcase.

42
00:02:05.852 --> 00:02:08.725
Your turn. Say: Suitcase.

43
00:02:11.425 --> 00:02:12.531
Suitcase.

44
00:02:13.517 --> 00:02:15.679
Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:15.979 --> 00:02:19.302
Rithy, where do you want to go on your dream holiday?

46
00:02:20.617 --> 00:02:23.034
I want to travel to Japan by plane.

47
00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:25.688
What will you do there?

48
00:02:26.983 --> 00:02:29.772
I will visit Mount Fuji and eat sushi.

49
00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:32.351
Where will you stay?

50
00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:37.417
I will stay in a hotel. I will pack a big suitcase!

51
00:02:38.717 --> 00:02:41.680
Grammar focus: I want to  and I will .

52
00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:45.352
I want to travel by plane. I will visit the beach.

53
00:02:45.652 --> 00:02:48.940
Use 'want to' for wishes and 'will' for future plans.

54
00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:53.009
Now read and listen. Dreaming of a Holiday.

55
00:02:53.309 --> 00:02:57.143
For my dream holiday, I want to travel by plane with my family.

56
00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:00.624
First, I will pack my suitcase.

57
00:03:01.917 --> 00:03:04.392
We will stay in a hotel near the beach.

58
00:03:05.683 --> 00:03:07.915
Every morning, I will swim in the sea.

59
00:03:09.217 --> 00:03:13.457
I also want to visit a mountain and see snow for the first time.

60
00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.251
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:17.551 --> 00:03:19.597
I want blank travel by plane.

62
00:03:19.897 --> 00:03:23.098
A, to. B, for. C, at.

63
00:03:27.083 --> 00:03:29.687
The answer is A: to.

64
00:03:31.183 --> 00:03:32.951
We blank stay in a hotel.

65
00:03:33.251 --> 00:03:36.347
A, will. B, wills. C, willing.

66
00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.512
The answer is A: will.

67
00:03:44.017 --> 00:03:46.620
A bag for clothes when you travel is a blank.

68
00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:50.922
A, suitcase. B, plane. C, beach.

69
00:03:54.917 --> 00:03:57.160
The answer is A: suitcase.

70
00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:02.347
Now it's your turn to speak. Where would you go on your dream holiday?

71
00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:12.471
I want to go to Australia. I will see kangaroos, and I will swim at the beach.

72
00:04:12.771 --> 00:04:14.561
Excellent answer, Rithy!

73
00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:20.513
Great work today! You learned eight new words and i want to  and i will .

74
00:04:20.813 --> 00:04:25.195
Today's value is dreams. Dream big and plan your adventures.

75
00:04:25.495 --> 00:04:28.403
See you in Unit twenty-five. Goodbye!

76
00:04:28.703 --> 00:04:31.425
Thank you, Ms. Sarah! Bye, everyone!

